{
 "fps": 30,
 "totalFrames": 1739,
 "lines": [
  {
   "i": 0,
   "speaker": "narrator",
   "text": "You land in Houston and start walking. The hallway just keeps going.",
   "from": 0,
   "to": 104
  },
  {
   "i": 1,
   "speaker": "narrator",
   "text": "By the time you reach baggage claim, your suitcase is already rolling out.",
   "from": 108,
   "to": 211
  },
  {
   "i": 2,
   "speaker": "narrator",
   "text": "Perfect timing. You feel so lucky.",
   "from": 215,
   "to": 265
  },
  {
   "i": 3,
   "speaker": "narrator",
   "text": "Then a staff door swings open. A manager is dragging your gate to the far end of the map.",
   "from": 269,
   "to": 400
  },
  {
   "i": 4,
   "speaker": "manager",
   "text": "Keep them walking. They never complain.",
   "from": 416,
   "to": 491
  },
  {
   "i": 5,
   "speaker": "narrator",
   "text": "This airport used to drown in complaints about waiting for bags.",
   "from": 494,
   "to": 588
  },
  {
   "i": 6,
   "speaker": "narrator",
   "text": "So they hired more baggage handlers, and the wait fell to eight minutes.",
   "from": 592,
   "to": 674
  },
  {
   "i": 7,
   "speaker": "narrator",
   "text": "People kept complaining anyway.",
   "from": 677,
   "to": 713
  },
  {
   "i": 8,
   "speaker": "narrator",
   "text": "Then someone timed it. One minute of walking, seven minutes standing at the belt.",
   "from": 717,
   "to": 841
  },
  {
   "i": 9,
   "speaker": "narrator",
   "text": "The problem wasn't the wait. It was the standing.",
   "from": 845,
   "to": 911
  },
  {
   "i": 10,
   "speaker": "narrator",
   "text": "So they moved the arrival gates away and sent the bags to the farthest belt.",
   "from": 914,
   "to": 1043
  },
  {
   "i": 11,
   "speaker": "narrator",
   "text": "Now passengers walked six times longer, and complaints dropped to almost zero.",
   "from": 1047,
   "to": 1171
  },
  {
   "i": 12,
   "speaker": "narrator",
   "text": "In nineteen eighty-five, a waiting expert wrote the rule down. Busy time feels shorter than empty time.",
   "from": 1175,
   "to": 1326
  },
  {
   "i": 13,
   "speaker": "narrator",
   "text": "It's why one hotel put mirrors next to its slow elevators.",
   "from": 1329,
   "to": 1422
  },
  {
   "i": 14,
   "speaker": "narrator",
   "text": "Guests fixed their hair, and the complaints stopped.",
   "from": 1425,
   "to": 1499
  },
  {
   "i": 15,
   "speaker": "narrator",
   "text": "Your wait never got shorter. It just got hidden in your legs.",
   "from": 1502,
   "to": 1587
  },
  {
   "i": 16,
   "speaker": "narrator",
   "text": "Next trip, your gate is the farthest again. You smile the whole way.",
   "from": 1591,
   "to": 1715
  }
 ],
